// DRAFT (Act III, planning only). Ch20 U02 the release: Kahre. His mid-fight line to Kerrid ("It doesn't hurt, son.") is
// in ch20_bark_vowbound_fights. Here he lifts; Kerrid nods, doesn't answer. The smith's hammer (the keepsake) goes last.
title: ch20_kahre_release
location: ch20/undertow_layers
---
@letterbox on
@camera U11
@music release_sting fade=0.0
@anim kahre set_down hammer
@wait 2.0
Kahre as "Daro" [soft_smile]: There. Tools down. #line:ch20_kahre_002
@anim kerrid nod kahre
@vfx glimmer_lift at=kahre count=40 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 6.0
@vfx glimmer_lift at=smiths_hammer count=1 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 4.0
<<set $ch20_kahre_released = true>>
@letterbox off
===
